&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-327216-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Doctor Wondertainment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-327216-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. An odorless, viscous, toxic fluid with a sweet taste typically used in the production of anti-freeze and polyester fibers.&lt;/div&gt;
