						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <br /> <br /> <div style="padding: 10px; border: 2px solid black; width: 80%; margin: auto;"> <p>When I was young, the elders told me, flowers in Astra town are not allowed to pick.</p> <p>There is a legend in Astra town. On the night of the new moon, people in town who are about to die will turn into flowers. The flowers in the town are all silver, just like a few stars scattered on the earth.</p> <p>Once, I asked an elder if the legend is true. He didn't answer. He was silent and looked up at the stars. For a long time, he read a poem:</p> <p>Youth passes as a fleeting river, star lies in the silver flower.</p> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <hr /> <table class="scale EN-base"> <tr> <td class="class1"> <h1><span><span class="base false EN">3/5179</span> LEVEL <span class="base false EN">3/5179</span></span></h1> <h1><span>CLASSIFIED</span></h1> </td> <td class="class1image" rowspan="2"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/component:classified-decoration-base/classified-lv3.png" alt="classified-lv3.png" class="image" /></td> <td class="item1 EN"> <h1><span>Item #: SCP-5179</span></h1> <h1><span>Object Class: Euclid</span></h1> </td> </tr> </table> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5179 is to remain permanently closed to civilian traffic. The project is to be fenced and marked with quarantine signs, warning of Natural Reserve.</p> <p><br /></p> <div style="padding: 10px; border: 2px solid black; width: 80%; margin: auto;"> <p>Even if I work in a foreign land now, I still think of the flowers in the town. Five trivial petals surround the alabastrum, like a silver bell lying on the ground. The flower will only open on the night of the new moon. On other days, the bridal flowers are like maiden sleeping deeply.</p> <p>When I was still young, I had been to an