script:;" >44</a>. No O5-055 exists</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-45"><a href="javascript:;" >45</a>. Cain has no sense of humor</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-46"><a href="javascript:;" >46</a>. Task was delegated to Junior Researcher ███████, who has since tendered her resignation due to being used for “Unethical labor”</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-47"><a href="javascript:;" >47</a>. Widely regarded as the most difficult campaign in the history of D&amp;D</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-48"><a href="javascript:;" >48</a>. While metagaming and loophole exploit would seem like the obvious path to take, The Box appears to know the intent of the players and will bend the scenario to murder their characters early.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-49"><a href="javascript:;" >49</a>. The closest attempt to beat the campaign came from Myself, Junior Researcher Geol Etas and subject D-997013, who made it all the way to the final battle with Acererak. Subject D-997013 has been relieved of his duty as D-class personnel and is to be considered a member of my research team until further notice.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-50"><a href="javascript:;" >50</a>. <em>I didn't know Dr. ████ was so talented</em> -Dr. Shelster</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-51"><a href="javascript:;" >51</a>. <em>How would that even work? Besides the fact you can't look at it, it can't see anyways</em> - Dr. Matism</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-52"><a href="javascript:;" >52</a>. <em>That's just cheap</em> -Doctor Aiden</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-53"><a href="javascript:;" >53</a>. <em>I Guess Dr. Bright was actually correct</em> -Researcher Iknowstuff</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-54"><a href="javascript:;" >54</a>. <em>How the fuck does every D-Class on site have a shellfish allergy?!</em> - Researcher Humphrey</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-55"><a href="javascript:;" >55</a>. When pushed, a 'ding' sound was heard and a fruit fly appeared out of nowhere.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-56"><a href="javascript:;" >56</a>. <em>&quot;I wanted my username to be Hugh G. Rection.&quot;</em> -D-8379</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-57"><a href="javascript:;" >57</a>. <em>&quot;Fuck no&quot;</em> -Dr. Pook</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-58"><a href="javascript:;" >58</a>. <em>&quot;I do know all fifty states, I just refuse to recognize Indiana as one.&quot;</em> -Dr. Oekn</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-59"><a href="javascript:;" >59</a>. The task was assigned to Junior Researcher ███, who has requested resignation.</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-60"><a href="javascript:;" >60</a>. &quot;<em>Eh, I'll finish it up later.</em>&quot; - Dr. &quot;K&quot;</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-61"><a href="javascript:;" >61</a>. &quot;<em>no no no noNONONONONOFUUUUUUUUU[DATA EXPUNGED]</em>&quot; -Dr. 'K&quot;</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-62"><a href="javascript:;" >62</a>. Junior Researcher Philip died of a sudden heart attack after entering &quot;21&quot; into the keypad. A note dispensed from the box reading &quot;Hahaha real funny, Philip.&quot;</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-63"><a href="javascript:;" >63</a>. To prevent the morale of staff assigned to this project from completely disappearing, the 05 council has decided to discontinue attempting to unlock this lock. &#8212; 05-7</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-64"><a href="javascript:;" >64</a>. <em>His lips tasted like calamari</em> -Dr. Brine</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-65"><a href="javascript:;" >65</a>. <em>What the shit?</em> -Director Irkiv</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-66"><a href="javascript:;" >66</a>. <em>Oh shit</em> -Dr. Brine</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-542559-67"><a href="javascript:;" >67</a>. <em>?????</em> -Researcher Hayden</div> </div> 
