&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span&gt;14 April, 1992 CE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Temple of Many Hands Society&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Where have you taken us?” Cynthia asked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“Well, this was somewhere I retreated to a long time ago,” Marquez said. “Its outside of the baseline reality, a pocket dimension. We shouldn’t have to worry about the Foundation or US Federal Authorities here.”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;He turned to the twenty-odd members of the Second Haptic Assembly who had &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5512&quot;&gt;followed him from Boston&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;It’ll be different this time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
